545
00:32:31.616 --> 00:32:33.618
Wait, you said the factory will lay off at least twenty people.

546
00:32:33.702 --> 00:32:35.871
Only two people were laid off at the headquarters?

547
00:32:36.788 --> 00:32:37.664
What's wrong?

548
00:32:37.747 --> 00:32:40.292
Your statement keeps changing. What's going on?

549
00:32:40.375 --> 00:32:44.129
What are you doing? Please, senior

550
00:32:44.212 --> 00:32:46.298
This isn't your style

551
00:32:46.381 --> 00:32:49.050
Factory staff should be reduced by more than 20%

552
00:32:49.134 --> 00:32:51.428
The headquarters remains intact?

553
00:32:51.511 --> 00:32:52.804
What kind of structural adjustment is this?

554
00:32:52.888 --> 00:32:54.806
How can this make sense?

555
00:32:54.890 --> 00:32:55.765
Brother

556
00:32:56.933 --> 00:32:59.436
Telecom company actually operates its own cable factory

557
00:32:59.519 --> 00:33:02.230
This is the most unreasonable

558
00:33:02.314 --> 00:33:03.190
Do you know what I mean?

559
00:33:03.940 --> 00:33:04.858
What do you mean?

560
00:33:06.234 --> 00:33:07.527
This place is closing next year

561
00:33:10.071 --> 00:33:11.907
- What?
- The factory is closing

562
00:33:12.699 --> 00:33:14.826
A large group carrying such junk assets?

563
00:33:14.910 --> 00:33:16.578
We are the only family in the world

564
00:33:16.661 --> 00:33:19.831
So we gradually implemented the voluntary severance plan

565
00:33:19.915 --> 00:33:21.625
If it shuts down suddenly

566
00:33:21.708 --> 00:33:24.377
They will take illegal and administrative lawsuits
It's such an uproar

567
00:33:24.461 --> 00:33:25.754
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

568
00:33:25.837 --> 00:33:27.005
Aren't I talking now?

569
00:33:27.088 --> 00:33:28.673
You should have told me from the beginning!

570
00:33:28.757 --> 00:33:30.926
- Brother, who are you?
- Hello!

571
00:33:34.596 --> 00:33:38.475
Brother, why should I report everything to you?

572
00:33:39.309 --> 00:33:40.310
Am I an errand boy?

573
00:33:40.393 --> 00:33:42.854
Really going crazy

574
00:33:45.273 --> 00:33:47.442
Brother, what happened to the errand boy?

575
00:33:47.526 --> 00:33:51.029
Don't you have any idea?
Do you really think you are a big shot?

576
00:33:51.112 --> 00:33:52.364
you bastard

577
00:34:12.842 --> 00:34:14.553
That time of super gigabit broadband

578
00:34:14.636 --> 00:34:17.097
You made such a big mistake

579
00:34:17.180 --> 00:34:20.100
It’s time to pack up and leave long ago
But the company let you go

580
00:34:20.183 --> 00:34:23.436
You should kneel down and be grateful

581
00:34:23.520 --> 00:34:26.439
It would be nice to have you as an errand boy.
Otherwise, what else can you do?

582
00:34:26.523 --> 00:34:27.607
Right

583
00:34:28.775 --> 00:34:30.569
What kind of security management are you doing here?

584
00:34:30.652 --> 00:34:33.405
That's why this mess happened, right?

585
00:34:36.783 --> 00:34:39.619
Brother, let’s work hard

586
00:34:40.954 --> 00:34:42.581
If you don't want to do it, just leave.

587
00:34:46.209 --> 00:34:48.211
Really terrible

588
00:34:55.594 --> 00:34:56.720
Senior

589
00:34:57.512 --> 00:35:00.724
You have two days left
We are still far from our goal

590
00:35:00.807 --> 00:35:02.684
please

591
00:35:30.545 --> 00:35:31.504
(no crossing the line)

592
00:35:31.588 --> 00:35:32.964
How many people will be fired?

593
00:35:33.048 --> 00:35:34.132
How do I know?

594
00:35:35.008 --> 00:35:38.345
The accident happened in our production line
Do we have to take responsibility?

595
00:35:38.428 --> 00:35:40.889
Why should we take responsibility?

596
00:35:40.972 --> 00:35:42.641
There are so many leaders

597
00:35:42.724 --> 00:35:45.769
There is a problem with the device
I have reported this to management many times

598
00:35:45.852 --> 00:35:49.147
- I still have a lot of loans to pay off.
- There are a lot of things to spend money on.

599
00:35:49.230 --> 00:35:50.398
- It's all over
- Who says it's not?

600
00:35:50.482 --> 00:35:52.108
Why are everyone so downcast?

601
00:35:53.610 --> 00:35:56.363
Let's go eat first. You must not have even had lunch.

602
00:35:57.614 --> 00:35:59.282
Let’s fill our stomachs before we talk, okay?

603
00:36:01.826 --> 00:36:03.203
It’s time to eat!

604
00:36:04.579 --> 00:36:05.914
It’s time to eat

605
00:36:07.916 --> 00:36:08.917
It’s time to eat

606
00:36:09.000 --> 00:36:10.752
(Stone Barbecue)

607
00:36:10.835 --> 00:36:13.149
Come on cheers

608
00:36:13.630 --> 00:36:16.591
- This stone baking pan is amazing
- Right?

609
00:36:16.675 --> 00:36:18.218
Then I won't be polite

610
00:36:26.476 --> 00:36:29.813
- This gravy is amazing.
- I told you this store is great.

611
00:36:29.896 --> 00:36:32.482
Really delicious
How did you find this place, Agent Zheng?

612
00:36:32.565 --> 00:36:33.942
Thanks to you, I unlocked another gourmet restaurant

613
00:36:34.567 --> 00:36:36.152
Eat more

614
00:36:36.236 --> 00:36:38.196
Wait for the minister to come back

615
00:36:38.279 --> 00:36:40.657
We have to go to Dudali restaurant every day again

616
00:36:41.825 --> 00:36:43.535
Wait, is it confirmed?

617
00:36:43.618 --> 00:36:44.869
Usually the human resources team leader

618
00:36:44.953 --> 00:36:47.831
I won't leave the factory just because of an accident.

619
00:36:47.914 --> 00:36:49.416
So there must be something inside

620
00:36:50.208 --> 00:36:51.918
- That's it
- Song Xi

621
00:36:52.836 --> 00:36:54.504
You have to be on the right side

622
00:36:55.255 --> 00:36:56.589
Agent, your avatar is not

623
00:36:56.673 --> 00:36:58.800
Photos of you and the Minister arm-in-arm?

624
00:36:59.426 --> 00:37:01.761
Yes, ouch, what should I do?

625
00:37:02.303 --> 00:37:04.139
(recent photo)

626
00:37:04.222 --> 00:37:07.225
I'll change it to a photo with both of them in it.

627
00:37:07.308 --> 00:37:10.437
"Leaders I respect"

628
00:37:11.062 --> 00:37:12.188
add love

629
00:37:12.272 --> 00:37:13.648
You are hopeless

630
00:37:13.732 --> 00:37:17.444
Whatever you say, Songxi
You can be as noble as this stone

631
00:37:17.527 --> 00:37:19.487
Anyway, I don't feel ashamed at all

632
00:37:22.365 --> 00:37:24.409
(No. 5 No. 6 No. 7)

633
00:37:28.329 --> 00:37:30.582
(Production Line No. 1 Yoon Hyo-sik)

634
00:37:32.375 --> 00:37:34.794
(No. 21 Evaluator: Kim Nak-soo)

635
00:37:39.507 --> 00:37:41.092
(security violation personnel)

636
00:37:43.386 --> 00:37:48.057
(Final list of security violators
Candidates for voluntary resignation)

637
00:37:57.901 --> 00:37:59.110
What's wrong?

638
00:38:01.362 --> 00:38:03.072
If you have nothing to say, I will hang up.

639
00:38:03.698 --> 00:38:04.574
Yeah

640
00:38:05.825 --> 00:38:08.203
- You want me to hang up?
- No

641
00:38:09.078 --> 00:38:10.079
What are you doing?

642
00:38:11.122 --> 00:38:12.081
What are you doing?

643
00:38:12.165 --> 00:38:15.126
I have an interview on the weekend

644
00:38:15.210 --> 00:38:18.171
no suitable clothes

645
00:38:18.254 --> 00:38:19.547
Go to a real estate agency?

646
00:38:20.298 --> 00:38:22.842
- Yes
- If you don’t find anything suitable, just buy it.

647
00:38:24.385 --> 00:38:26.471
OK, let's see

648
00:38:27.639 --> 00:38:29.557
- Try to pass the interview
- I will

649
00:38:32.018 --> 00:38:35.563
What's wrong? You said you didn't want me to work before.

650
00:38:36.356 --> 00:38:37.315
I don't know either

651
00:38:39.442 --> 00:38:40.318
Are you sick?

652
00:38:41.569 --> 00:38:42.487
No

653
00:38:42.570 --> 00:38:43.488
By the way, husband

654
00:38:44.489 --> 00:38:48.201
How much bonus do you think you can get during the Mid-Autumn Festival this year?

655
00:38:48.701 --> 00:38:49.577
Why do you ask?

656
00:38:49.661 --> 00:38:53.248
I'm thinking of just paying the balance of the mortgage

657
00:38:53.331 --> 00:38:56.000
Pay off in one lump sum

658
00:38:56.084 --> 00:38:58.378
What did you say?

659
00:38:58.461 --> 00:39:01.381
You will have to pay liquidated damages for early repayment.

660
00:39:01.464 --> 00:39:05.009
If our loan has been completed for three years, the penalty will be waived.

661
00:39:05.718 --> 00:39:08.555
The interest alone costs 8 million won per year

662
00:39:08.638 --> 00:39:10.640
It's better to pay it off as soon as possible.

663
00:39:10.723 --> 00:39:13.685
Interest rates fluctuate back and forth. Just looking at them makes me upset.

664
00:39:13.768 --> 00:39:15.603
Just keep it as is, okay?

665
00:39:15.687 --> 00:39:17.647
Where did you hear this nonsense?

666
00:39:17.730 --> 00:39:20.024
Where did I hear that?

667
00:39:20.108 --> 00:39:23.069
I'm a licensed real estate agent
Remember?

668
00:39:24.153 --> 00:39:26.906
Anyway, once this bonus arrives, you must not touch it.

669
00:39:26.990 --> 00:39:29.993
if it's not enough
Just put together next year’s Spring Festival bonus and pay it back

670
00:39:30.076 --> 00:39:31.744
- Do you know?
- I'm hung up

671
00:39:31.828 --> 00:39:34.914
You received the pickled abalone from mom...

672
00:39:48.219 --> 00:39:49.095
Team Leader Kim

673
00:39:50.722 --> 00:39:52.015
hello

674
00:39:52.098 --> 00:39:53.474
Have you eaten?

675
00:39:53.558 --> 00:39:55.059
- What?
- He definitely didn't eat

676
00:39:55.143 --> 00:39:56.311
- Let's go in
- Where to go?

677
00:39:56.394 --> 00:39:57.270
- let's go
- What?

678
00:39:57.353 --> 00:39:59.022
- let's go
- Where to go?

679
00:39:59.105 --> 00:40:00.523
This way

680
00:40:01.566 --> 00:40:02.567
- Coming
- What?

681
00:40:02.650 --> 00:40:06.654
Soak the dishes in the sink before leaving, you know?

682
00:40:06.738 --> 00:40:08.031
- Got it. Goodbye.
- thank you

683
00:40:08.114 --> 00:40:09.741
- You guys are delicious.
- Goodbye

684
00:40:09.824 --> 00:40:11.075
- Goodbye
- Yeah

685
00:40:11.159 --> 00:40:14.954
Attention everyone, Team Leader Jin is here.

686
00:40:15.038 --> 00:40:16.414
Everyone applauds

687
00:40:22.378 --> 00:40:23.671
- Please take a seat
- Team Leader Kim

688
00:40:23.755 --> 00:40:25.548
It seems inappropriate for me to come here

689
00:40:25.632 --> 00:40:26.841
Where are you talking? Please sit down

690
00:40:26.925 --> 00:40:28.593
come sit here

691
00:40:29.260 --> 00:40:31.638
You sit here

692
00:40:32.180 --> 00:40:35.224
Then I'll sit down for a while

693
00:40:37.435 --> 00:40:39.145
Team Leader Kim, let me get you a drink.

694
00:40:39.228 --> 00:40:41.022
Just a glass of soju. Thank you.

695
00:40:41.773 --> 00:40:43.441
Wait a minute

696
00:40:43.524 --> 00:40:44.943
Pour this for Team Leader Kim

697
00:40:45.026 --> 00:40:45.902
(Pavanox)

698
00:40:46.736 --> 00:40:47.737
What is this?

699
00:40:47.820 --> 00:40:48.738
- Oh my god
- Good guy

700
00:40:49.781 --> 00:40:53.242
This is the sauce-roasted tofu my wife sent me.
Please try it

701
00:40:54.327 --> 00:40:57.455
Sautéed tofu is her specialty

702
00:40:57.538 --> 00:40:58.998
God thank you

703
00:40:59.082 --> 00:41:00.667
What is this doing?

704
00:41:00.750 --> 00:41:02.377
Why are you giving him foreign wine?

705
00:41:02.460 --> 00:41:04.837
You're drunk. Sit down.

706
00:41:04.921 --> 00:41:06.839
- Don’t take it out on the team leader
- Think about it

707
00:41:06.923 --> 00:41:09.550
Does he deserve to drink?

708
00:41:09.634 --> 00:41:12.553
He is worried that he can't find a reason to fire us.

709
00:41:12.637 --> 00:41:13.680
Calm down bro

710
00:41:13.763 --> 00:41:15.890
Pay attention to the occasion and sit down first

711
00:41:15.974 --> 00:41:17.767
- Have a seat
- I can't lose this job

712
00:41:18.601 --> 00:41:21.270
I have two parents who are over 90 years old at home.

713
00:41:21.354 --> 00:41:23.523
hey that's enough

714
00:41:23.606 --> 00:41:26.818
Are you alone in trouble?
Whose parents here are not sick or in pain?

715
00:41:26.901 --> 00:41:28.403
Brother, have you saved any money?

716
00:41:29.070 --> 00:41:30.279
I only saved debt

717
00:41:30.363 --> 00:41:31.489
Team leader, let's have a drink

718
00:41:32.407 --> 00:41:33.366
Team leader

719
00:41:34.200 --> 00:41:36.494
Last month I reported machine anomalies to you

720
00:41:36.577 --> 00:41:38.621
Need to shut down for maintenance

721
00:41:38.705 --> 00:41:41.332
Hey, if the delivery time is delayed
Can you take responsibility?

722
00:41:41.958 --> 00:41:45.670
If we want to lay off young people, we should lay off young people first, right?

723
00:41:45.753 --> 00:41:47.255
- Us?
- That's you

724
00:41:47.338 --> 00:41:52.093
What he means is that young people have more opportunities, so...

725
00:41:52.176 --> 00:41:55.221
What opportunity? Where?

726
00:41:55.304 --> 00:41:58.349
How do I know? There are more than us. Go out and look for it.

727
00:41:58.433 --> 00:41:59.726
Bro please

728
00:42:00.268 --> 00:42:03.396
The rule in the factory is first come first go

729
00:42:03.479 --> 00:42:06.566
Talent fairness in order of seniority

730
00:42:06.649 --> 00:42:07.900
This is too much to say

731
00:42:07.984 --> 00:42:10.528
So we old guys should just get out?

732
00:42:10.611 --> 00:42:11.863
Brother, listen

733
00:42:11.946 --> 00:42:14.115
To be honest, you guys are moving too slowly

734
00:42:14.657 --> 00:42:17.118
No, I'm just slow in everything I do.

735
00:42:17.201 --> 00:42:20.747
To put it bluntly, you can't even meet the quota.

736
00:42:20.830 --> 00:42:23.458
These young people here

737
00:42:23.541 --> 00:42:26.085
- I've all been dragged down by you.
- "Drag"?

738
00:42:29.088 --> 00:42:31.591
Dazai, you just said "drag"?

739
00:42:31.674 --> 00:42:34.802
Brother, are your ears not working well?

740
00:42:36.012 --> 00:42:36.971
- Can't you hear me?
- Oh my god, hey.

741
00:42:37.055 --> 00:42:38.848
"Drag"!

742
00:42:38.931 --> 00:42:41.476
- What?
- Hey, you little bastards

743
00:42:41.559 --> 00:42:45.772
Who do you think taught you technology?
So that you can make a living in the factory?

744
00:42:45.855 --> 00:42:46.814
If not for me

745
00:42:46.898 --> 00:42:50.943
You've already broken several of your fingers, asshole.

746
00:42:51.027 --> 00:42:54.906
God, thank you for saving my finger.

747
00:42:54.989 --> 00:42:56.699
But are you born with it?

748
00:42:56.783 --> 00:42:59.118
- Where are the masters who took care of you back then?
- shit

749
00:42:59.202 --> 00:43:00.161
- Hey stop
- What?

750
00:43:00.244 --> 00:43:02.455
Now you want to throw all the blame on us?

751
00:43:02.538 --> 00:43:05.875
- Team Leader Jin How old is your child?
- Who said I passed the blame?

752
00:43:05.958 --> 00:43:07.048
- catch him
- Come here

753
00:43:07.627 --> 00:43:09.879
You little bastards

754
00:43:10.546 --> 00:43:13.216
Hey, stop making trouble!

755
00:43:20.598 --> 00:43:23.226
The food is all set

756
00:43:24.102 --> 00:43:27.647
I asked the cafeteria aunt to work overtime and make omelettes and so on.

757
00:43:27.730 --> 00:43:31.609
Please eat some, please

758
00:43:33.736 --> 00:43:34.946
Take a seat

759
00:43:35.029 --> 00:43:36.489
- Really
- sit down

760
00:43:36.572 --> 00:43:38.199
- Have a seat
- Dazai, put on your clothes

761
00:43:55.133 --> 00:43:56.551
Not as good as...

762
00:43:58.136 --> 00:44:00.263
How about I make you guys a killer bomb?

763
00:44:03.099 --> 00:44:04.559
ok come on

764
00:44:04.642 --> 00:44:10.356
This is me running sales in ACT for 25 years
The refined golden ratio

765
00:44:10.857 --> 00:44:13.192
This is not the kind of drink that everyone can drink

766
00:44:13.276 --> 00:44:16.028
The ordinary bomb liquor you can drink anywhere

767
00:44:16.112 --> 00:44:18.948
The formula alone is not enough, you also need to pay attention to the technique.

768
00:44:19.031 --> 00:44:20.449
Keep your eyes open and watch

769
00:44:20.533 --> 00:44:24.453
Come on!

770
00:44:25.454 --> 00:44:29.000
The upper level is overflowing, so the bottom level can be full.

771
00:44:29.083 --> 00:44:31.085
This is called trickle-down effect wine

772
00:44:31.169 --> 00:44:33.129
Very good

773
00:44:35.006 --> 00:44:37.216
- Who wants a drink? You're welcome
- me

774
00:44:37.300 --> 00:44:40.219
Okay, 10,000 won. Thank you.

775
00:44:40.761 --> 00:44:43.431
I'll send you account information

776
00:44:43.514 --> 00:44:46.934
Pass back and forth

777
00:44:47.018 --> 00:44:48.728
I continue to adjust

778
00:44:48.811 --> 00:44:51.689
Even if you quarrel, you have to clink glasses first

779
00:44:52.565 --> 00:44:56.235
After all, we are all family and we have to look after each other.

780
00:44:56.777 --> 00:44:58.279
- Look out for each other!
- Look out for each other!

781
00:45:06.746 --> 00:45:08.372
Let's go

782
00:45:08.456 --> 00:45:10.291
Good guy, it's really cold these nights.

783
00:45:11.542 --> 00:45:12.627
Yes

784
00:45:15.296 --> 00:45:16.672
What does headquarters say?

785
00:45:17.715 --> 00:45:20.468
Should we lay off all the people involved in the production line accident?

786
00:45:24.680 --> 00:45:25.765
Team Leader Kim

787
00:45:26.682 --> 00:45:29.101
I don't know, I don't know

788
00:45:29.185 --> 00:45:30.102
If...

789
00:45:30.186 --> 00:45:32.688
What if it was me who left?

790
00:45:35.775 --> 00:45:36.651
Why you?

791
00:45:38.694 --> 00:45:41.280
Because I am the homework monitor

792
00:45:41.364 --> 00:45:43.366
I'm still the leader of the security management team.

793
00:45:47.536 --> 00:45:48.871
You've seen it all

794
00:45:50.498 --> 00:45:52.708
No one here can afford to lose their job

795
00:45:54.377 --> 00:45:56.671
Laying off a few old employees will have no effect

796
00:45:56.754 --> 00:45:58.965
Why don't you just make a symbolic statement?

797
00:45:59.548 --> 00:46:01.717
Let’s lay off a young work monitor

798
00:46:01.801 --> 00:46:03.844
please

799
00:46:04.887 --> 00:46:06.055
What do you do?

800
00:46:06.806 --> 00:46:09.684
Me? There are so many places for me

801
00:46:10.351 --> 00:46:12.687
Everyone knows that I do things neatly

802
00:46:13.604 --> 00:46:14.522
Oh my god

803
00:46:17.191 --> 00:46:19.860
I will bear all the responsibilities

804
00:46:20.736 --> 00:46:21.862
Just do it

805
00:46:25.574 --> 00:46:27.618
Do you know what you are talking about?

806
00:46:27.702 --> 00:46:28.953
i know

807
00:46:30.329 --> 00:46:33.332
The person who cannot be laid off the most here

808
00:46:33.416 --> 00:46:34.417
it's you

809
00:46:35.626 --> 00:46:38.421
The business is strong enough and he is an excellent manager.

810
00:46:38.504 --> 00:46:41.382
Even if this factory is completely closed

811
00:46:41.465 --> 00:46:43.968
You should continue working in the group

812
00:46:44.760 --> 00:46:46.304
I think that's it

813
00:46:46.387 --> 00:46:50.057
Now is not the time for you to be a hero

814
00:46:50.141 --> 00:46:51.517
What is your responsibility?

815
00:46:51.600 --> 00:46:54.395
Do you think the company is child's play?
Can I use them at will?

816
00:46:54.478 --> 00:46:56.981
They have settled the accounts long ago

817
00:46:57.064 --> 00:46:59.317
Everything thrown away is useless

818
00:46:59.400 --> 00:47:04.030
That's why I asked you for help

819
00:47:04.113 --> 00:47:07.700
I've been working with numbers for 25 years

820
00:47:07.783 --> 00:47:10.911
You want me to chop you

821
00:47:10.995 --> 00:47:12.621
To protect those people?

822
00:47:12.705 --> 00:47:13.873
Your request is tantamount to saying

823
00:47:14.707 --> 00:47:17.835
"Team Leader Kim, please mess up your work."

824
00:47:19.545 --> 00:47:20.421
It's ridiculous

825
00:47:21.255 --> 00:47:22.465
i can't do it

826
00:47:26.802 --> 00:47:29.388
You are too young and too naive

827
00:47:31.640 --> 00:47:33.809
Stop saying those nonsense words

828
00:47:35.227 --> 00:47:38.314
Think about how to stay in the company
Hold on as long as you can

829
00:47:39.815 --> 00:47:41.359
This is the duty of being a parent

830
00:47:42.318 --> 00:47:43.819
Do you understand, you smart girl?

831
00:47:46.030 --> 00:47:47.490
leave it to the last minute

832
00:47:48.699 --> 00:47:50.242
take responsibility

833
00:47:51.535 --> 00:47:52.828
this is your job

834
00:47:53.704 --> 00:47:55.581
i will do my job

835
00:47:56.290 --> 00:47:57.208
ok?

836
00:48:01.379 --> 00:48:02.546
Right

837
00:48:03.214 --> 00:48:05.049
I never drink

838
00:48:06.425 --> 00:48:07.301
hold

839
00:48:08.886 --> 00:48:09.762
Give too much

840
00:48:15.935 --> 00:48:17.103
Good guy, it's so cold

841
00:48:23.776 --> 00:48:26.195
(ACT Building 1, ACT Building 2)

842
00:48:39.959 --> 00:48:41.836
(Beyond telecommunications, connect you and me)

843
00:49:01.188 --> 00:49:03.107
(Office of the Human Resources Team Leader)

844
00:49:03.190 --> 00:49:05.151
{\an8}(Human Resources Group)

845
00:49:13.868 --> 00:49:15.703
That's right, yes

846
00:49:15.786 --> 00:49:18.164
Wait for me three minutes

847
00:49:18.247 --> 00:49:20.124
- Sorry, wait a moment.
- OK

848
00:49:22.877 --> 00:49:23.752
yes

849
00:49:25.045 --> 00:49:26.005
Oh my god

850
00:49:26.088 --> 00:49:28.048
Just as I was talking, people arrived

851
00:49:28.716 --> 00:49:31.135
He must be in a hurry, he arrived early

852
00:49:32.052 --> 00:49:35.890
Isn't it? Just such a small thing

853
00:49:35.973 --> 00:49:38.392
It actually took so long

854
00:49:38.476 --> 00:49:40.936
Otherwise

855
00:49:41.020 --> 00:49:43.772
What do you think about having a meal together after work?

856
00:49:44.482 --> 00:49:48.527
Director Kim Nak-soo is the sales team’s ace in the drinking game.

857
00:49:49.487 --> 00:49:50.988
It's hot when he's around

858
00:49:51.071 --> 00:49:54.575
Okay, I'll contact you later, okay

859
00:49:56.994 --> 00:49:59.413
Senior, please come in quickly

860
00:50:00.206 --> 00:50:01.165
Sit here

861
00:50:08.422 --> 00:50:10.883
How does it feel to be back at headquarters?

862
00:50:12.259 --> 00:50:13.886
Not bad

863
00:50:13.969 --> 00:50:16.680
You have to come back early. It’s been a hard time.

864
00:50:16.764 --> 00:50:19.642
Think about what to eat later

865
00:50:20.726 --> 00:50:21.936
Waiting up there

866
00:50:24.355 --> 00:50:29.026
What happened that day was that I was rude.

867
00:50:29.860 --> 00:50:31.445
Please forgive me, senior

868
00:50:32.196 --> 00:50:33.072
I understand

869
00:50:35.366 --> 00:50:36.242
Really?

870
00:50:37.952 --> 00:50:38.953
That's good

871
00:50:40.287 --> 00:50:41.413
Please give me the list

872
00:50:50.297 --> 00:50:52.091
(Kim Nak Soo)

873
00:51:01.475 --> 00:51:04.895
If you didn't print it out, why not send it to me directly?

874
00:51:05.521 --> 00:51:08.274
Forget it, that's a wireless printer

875
00:51:08.357 --> 00:51:10.234
Connect to your mobile phone and print directly

876
00:51:10.317 --> 00:51:11.735
(List of security violators)

877
00:51:15.197 --> 00:51:17.241
(Production line No. 1: It is recommended that 20 people resign voluntarily)

878
00:51:17.324 --> 00:51:18.409
(No. 1 No. 2)

879
00:51:19.326 --> 00:51:21.036
Don't bother, senior. Just read it.

880
00:51:21.120 --> 00:51:22.621
Just 20 people

881
00:51:22.705 --> 00:51:23.998
Who is the first?

882
00:51:24.081 --> 00:51:26.166
Let's go eat when you're done, okay?

883
00:51:26.250 --> 00:51:27.543
Okay, who's the first one?

884
00:51:30.504 --> 00:51:31.380
(No. 6 Lee Dal Jae)

885
00:51:31.463 --> 00:51:32.881
(No. 7 Xu Zhengyuan No. 8)

886
00:51:42.766 --> 00:51:43.642
I want to apply

887
00:51:45.311 --> 00:51:46.812
Voluntary resignation

888
00:51:58.657 --> 00:52:00.576
(ACT Resignation Application Form)

889
00:52:08.000 --> 00:52:08.876
give

890
00:52:08.959 --> 00:52:12.463
Please fill in the date you want your voluntary separation to take effect

891
00:52:12.546 --> 00:52:14.548
Wait a minute. Sorry.

892
00:52:14.632 --> 00:52:17.384
This is last year's table. I need to check it.

893
00:52:19.887 --> 00:52:22.598
Forget it, don't worry about anything else

894
00:52:22.681 --> 00:52:25.142
Just sign the applicant's column

895
00:52:35.069 --> 00:52:38.864
Senior, you can tell me directly now

896
00:52:38.947 --> 00:52:41.659
Which day should I fill in for you?

897
00:52:41.742 --> 00:52:43.744
Next week? Tomorrow is fine too

898
00:52:43.827 --> 00:52:47.581
But it is always more cost-effective to receive a few more days of salary.

899
00:52:48.499 --> 00:52:50.042
You should know the rest of the process

900
00:52:50.125 --> 00:52:53.003
In addition to severance pay, there is also 200 million won in compensation.

901
00:52:53.629 --> 00:52:55.506
Will be transferred to your annuity account

902
00:52:55.589 --> 00:52:59.760
Unless there is a serious need, it is best to keep it

903
00:53:02.638 --> 00:53:03.681
How to determine the date?

904
00:53:04.932 --> 00:53:07.393
- next week
- OK

905
00:53:07.476 --> 00:53:10.938
Please sign so that I can submit it for approval immediately.

906
00:53:11.021 --> 00:53:12.481
(Applicant: Kim Nak-soo)

907
00:53:18.112 --> 00:53:19.029
Have you signed it?

908
00:53:20.948 --> 00:53:22.658
What about unemployment benefits?

909
00:53:22.741 --> 00:53:24.118
This can't be done

910
00:53:24.618 --> 00:53:26.328
You resigned voluntarily

911
00:53:27.371 --> 00:53:29.665
But this money is not from the company.

912
00:53:32.710 --> 00:53:33.877
Oh my god

913
00:53:39.383 --> 00:53:44.263
It's really interesting. It's your turn.
Suddenly I became more flexible.

914
00:53:45.347 --> 00:53:47.224
Please

915
00:53:59.653 --> 00:54:01.321
Senior, once you click submit...

916
00:54:01.405 --> 00:54:03.115
(Submit the employee's resignation application?)

917
00:54:03.782 --> 00:54:04.825
...it's really over

918
00:54:05.451 --> 00:54:06.702
Farewell

919
00:54:07.369 --> 00:54:09.580
no turning back

920
00:54:11.665 --> 00:54:15.794
ACT is your first job, senior, right?

921
00:54:15.878 --> 00:54:18.797
Join the workforce directly after graduating from university

922
00:54:18.881 --> 00:54:20.215
Except for tutoring

923
00:54:20.299 --> 00:54:22.926
You've never had any other job, right?

924
00:54:23.469 --> 00:54:24.470
Once you click submit

925
00:54:24.553 --> 00:54:29.349
You will start to rest on your laurels for the next 50 years of your life.

926
00:54:29.975 --> 00:54:33.312
It'll be over by then. There will be no more salary.

927
00:54:33.395 --> 00:54:34.897
Retirement bonus 330 million won

928
00:54:34.980 --> 00:54:37.483
How much is left after tax is deducted?

929
00:54:38.025 --> 00:54:40.527
How many years do you think it can last?

930
00:54:45.365 --> 00:54:46.283
list

931
00:54:47.326 --> 00:54:48.660
Can you give it to me?

932
00:54:51.288 --> 00:54:52.164
Really terrible

933
00:54:55.918 --> 00:54:59.171
Senior, let the factory return to normal as soon as possible

934
00:54:59.254 --> 00:55:01.256
You can also return to the headquarters

935
00:55:01.340 --> 00:55:04.176
Show your talents and get promoted to senior management

936
00:55:04.259 --> 00:55:08.388
In this way, the company can concentrate resources and move towards a new stage.

937
00:55:08.889 --> 00:55:10.557
your list

938
00:55:10.641 --> 00:55:14.645
It's the crucial first step in all this

939
00:55:17.523 --> 00:55:19.942
Could you please say something? What should we do?

940
00:55:20.025 --> 00:55:23.195
I'm really at my wits end

941
00:55:23.278 --> 00:55:25.405
This is the first time in your life to ask for help, okay?

942
00:55:26.365 --> 00:55:28.408
Senior!

943
00:55:28.951 --> 00:55:30.661
Say something!

944
00:55:36.875 --> 00:55:38.460
You talk too much

945
00:55:42.339 --> 00:55:44.132
(Submit the employee's resignation application?)

946
00:55:44.800 --> 00:55:46.635
(Kim Nak-soo, 25 years of service)

947
00:55:46.718 --> 00:55:48.595
(submitted confirmed)

948
00:55:50.722 --> 00:55:51.890
(Voluntary resignation application has been submitted)

949
00:55:51.974 --> 00:55:53.350
(This is the Administrative Support Team)

950
00:56:11.368 --> 00:56:14.413
(Minister Kim Nak-soo)

951
00:56:30.721 --> 00:56:32.389
(Minister Du Zhenyu)

952
00:56:36.643 --> 00:56:38.103
{\an8}(Zheng Chengjiu)

953
00:56:47.779 --> 00:56:49.323
{\an8}(Commendation to Kim Nak-soo)

954
00:57:00.751 --> 00:57:02.502
We exceeded our targets...

955
00:57:06.340 --> 00:57:09.051
Increased sales of flagship products...

956
00:57:13.555 --> 00:57:15.015
...17.9%...

957
00:57:18.894 --> 00:57:20.103
- Executive Bai
- Yes

958
00:57:21.188 --> 00:57:23.023
Sorry, continue

959
00:57:23.106 --> 00:57:24.566
Then I will continue

960
00:57:24.650 --> 00:57:26.777
You can see that compared to the first quarter

961
00:57:26.860 --> 00:57:28.445
There was a 12% growth in the second quarter

962
00:57:28.528 --> 00:57:29.821
(Choi Jae Hyuk, Human Resources Team Leader)

963
00:57:29.905 --> 00:57:31.949
(Kim Nak-soo applied for voluntary resignation and has left)

964
00:57:32.032 --> 00:57:34.242
Especially new contracts with small businesses...

965
00:57:50.634 --> 00:57:52.219
(Add waypoint)

966
00:57:52.302 --> 00:57:53.595
(Route planning completed)

967
00:57:53.679 --> 00:57:56.515
(home)

968
00:57:57.724 --> 00:57:59.101
God, I'm so exhausted.

969
00:57:59.184 --> 00:58:00.936
- Song Xi
- Huh?

970
00:58:01.019 --> 00:58:04.523
Which one do you choose, a one million salary increase or getting off work at four o'clock?

971
00:58:06.984 --> 00:58:08.902
I have to think about it carefully

972
00:58:08.986 --> 00:58:10.570
I will definitely choose to get off work at four o'clock

973
00:58:10.654 --> 00:58:12.406
This time passes too slowly.

974
00:58:19.204 --> 00:58:20.080
Has anyone been here?

975
00:58:20.163 --> 00:58:21.832
Who will come here?

976
00:58:22.499 --> 00:58:24.918
No, I seriously am...

977
00:58:26.294 --> 00:58:28.046
The air has changed. Do you know?

978
00:58:29.214 --> 00:58:32.759
I don’t want to work anymore
Using the air as an excuse is fresh enough

979
00:58:33.260 --> 00:58:35.137
No, it's true. What happened?

980
00:58:48.692 --> 00:58:51.653
(ACT Kim Nak-soo)

981
00:58:52.946 --> 00:58:53.822
No

982
00:59:02.205 --> 00:59:03.081
my god

983
00:59:04.750 --> 00:59:06.334
What? What happened?

984
00:59:12.758 --> 00:59:15.218
(Selling one set)

985
00:59:32.652 --> 00:59:33.945
I'm back

986
00:59:42.996 --> 00:59:44.206
What's wrong?

987
00:59:44.289 --> 00:59:45.499
Is there anything to eat?

988
00:59:47.042 --> 00:59:48.293
Yes

989
00:59:49.086 --> 00:59:50.128
Just bring me some

990
00:59:50.212 --> 00:59:52.422
OK OK

991
01:00:04.184 --> 01:00:06.478
Did you take half a day off or something?

992
01:00:12.943 --> 01:00:14.111
Right

993
01:00:21.910 --> 01:00:22.786
you see

994
01:00:24.704 --> 01:00:25.580
What?

995
01:00:25.664 --> 01:00:27.499
Didn't I say I had an interview on the weekend?

996
01:00:28.416 --> 01:00:30.293
- Real estate agency?
- Yes

997
01:00:32.546 --> 01:00:33.630
The one on the left

998
01:00:33.713 --> 01:00:34.714
This one?

999
01:00:36.842 --> 01:00:39.594
- I think this one is better
- I asked and didn’t listen. Then why did you ask?

1000
01:00:39.678 --> 01:00:44.099
Heying and I bought this at the department store today.

1001
01:00:44.182 --> 01:00:45.642
God, you don't know

1002
01:00:45.725 --> 01:00:47.310
She said she paid the bill

1003
01:00:47.394 --> 01:00:50.689
Who would have thought that after seeing the price tag, he would immediately change his mind?

1004
01:00:50.772 --> 01:00:54.609
She forgot how exhausted I was back then

1005
01:00:54.693 --> 01:00:58.697
I paid for her to go to school. She is such a heartless person.

1006
01:00:58.780 --> 01:01:01.575
I should have kept that car in the first place

1007
01:01:01.658 --> 01:01:02.659
Right?

1008
01:01:06.580 --> 01:01:07.914
Am I right?

1009
01:01:09.082 --> 01:01:10.167
Yes

1010
01:01:50.123 --> 01:01:51.333
What for?

1011
01:01:56.129 --> 01:01:57.130
What are you doing?

1012
01:02:01.468 --> 01:02:03.887
Hey stop

1013
01:02:06.681 --> 01:02:08.225
- Hey
- Stop it

1014
01:02:08.308 --> 01:02:09.392
Hey bum

1015
01:02:09.476 --> 01:02:12.312
- Hey Jin Wuye
- I'm serious. Stop it.

1016
01:02:13.355 --> 01:02:16.024
Your wife is going for an interview over the weekend

1017
01:02:16.107 --> 01:02:17.484
Are you just going to enjoy your leisure time?

1018
01:02:17.567 --> 01:02:19.402
- Don't do this
- Huh?

1019
01:02:20.654 --> 01:02:22.447
How much is the severance pay?

1020
01:02:22.530 --> 01:02:23.490
- Stop it
- take it out

1021
01:02:23.573 --> 01:02:25.367
give me

1022
01:02:25.867 --> 01:02:27.661
I want to buy bags and clothes

1023
01:02:27.744 --> 01:02:30.205
- I also want to travel abroad.
- I really can't stand you.

1024
01:02:30.288 --> 01:02:32.791
- Hurry up
- Get me something to eat.

1025
01:02:32.874 --> 01:02:34.793
Give me money I want money

1026
01:02:34.876 --> 01:02:36.253
If you give me one million won

1027
01:02:36.336 --> 01:02:38.213
- I'll cook you top-notch instant noodles
- OK

1028
01:02:38.296 --> 01:02:39.756
Really, I told you not to make trouble

1029
01:02:56.398 --> 01:02:57.774
You have worked hard these years

1030
01:02:58.817 --> 01:02:59.693
Minister Kim

1031
01:03:07.242 --> 01:03:08.243
sorry

1032
01:03:12.664 --> 01:03:14.833
What is there to be sorry for?

1033
01:03:54.622 --> 01:03:56.583
Husband

1034
01:04:12.098 --> 01:04:17.062
"Minister Kim's Dream Life"

1035
01:04:47.258 --> 01:04:49.135
{\an8}You were born to work

1036
01:04:49.219 --> 01:04:51.846
{\an8}Never do what you are thinking about right now.

1037
01:04:51.930 --> 01:04:53.681
{\an8}What will the brother-in-law do next?

1038
01:04:53.765 --> 01:04:55.725
{\an8}The severance package shouldn’t be much either.

1039
01:04:55.809 --> 01:04:58.436
{\an8}I don’t think it’s necessary for a group to participate
So I didn’t tell you

1040
01:04:58.520 --> 01:05:01.815
{\an8}This clearly means
We are Kim Nak Soo’s people after all

1041
01:05:01.898 --> 01:05:04.442
{\an8}The most I can give is 2 million

1042
01:05:04.526 --> 01:05:06.403
{\an8}I was the minister of a large company last week

1043
01:05:06.486 --> 01:05:08.446
{\an8}I can’t work with such a salary.

1044
01:05:08.530 --> 01:05:09.406
{\an8}(Representative Sol, Cho Yun-hyung)

1045
01:05:09.489 --> 01:05:11.574
{\an8}Is this the business you said you wanted to do together?

1046
01:05:12.742 --> 01:05:13.618
{\an8}(Dohan Real Estate)

1047
01:05:13.701 --> 01:05:14.661
{\an8}- Hello
- Oops

1048
01:05:14.744 --> 01:05:16.037
{\an8}I have been in the industry for so many years

1049
01:05:16.121 --> 01:05:18.498
{\an8}This location is definitely one of the best.

1050
01:05:18.581 --> 01:05:20.750
{\an8}This electric tension

1051
01:05:20.834 --> 01:05:22.877
{\an8}This feeling of all-or-nothing

1052
01:05:26.840 --> 01:05:28.842
Subtitle translation: Jia Xue

